Channel eldritch forces into a melee attack, hitting the target with your weapon and shield for [160%, 242%, 321%, 399%, 476% (TL1-5; SP 100)] arcane damage.

If either attack hits, the target will be stunned for [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] turns and you automatically Block.

The chance for the attack to stun increases with your Physical Power, but it is considered a magical attack and thus is resisted with spell save, rather than physical save.

Damage increases with Spellpower.
